%% M8 sequence: parcel event to signed webhook. Planned design: follows contracts/openapi/webhook-service.v1.yaml and issue #21.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P0 as parcel-service
    participant P1 as Kafka
    participant P2 as webhook-service
    participant P3 as MongoDB<br/>webhooks
    participant P4 as Redis<br/>BullMQ
    participant P5 as Merchant<br/>endpoint
        P0->>P1: outbox relay publishes ParcelStatusChanged (key parcelId)
        P1->>P2: deliver to group webhook-service
        P2->>P3: markIfFirst(eventId, consumer): atomic insert
        P3-->>P2: first time, or duplicate key
        alt duplicate event, or merchantId is null (customer parcel)
            P2->>P1: commit offset, no delivery is created
        else first delivery of a merchant parcel event
            P2->>P3: find active endpoints subscribed to the event type
            P3-->>P2: matching endpoints
            P2->>P3: per endpoint: insert delivery PENDING (unique endpointId + eventId)
            alt merchant is SUSPENDED
                P2->>P2: hold: the delivery stays PENDING, no job is queued
            else merchant is active
                P2->>P4: enqueue job (jobId = deliveryId)
            end
            P2->>P1: commit offset
            P4->>P2: worker takes the job
            P2->>P3: load the delivery and endpoint, decrypt the secret
            P2->>P2: build {id, type, createdAt, data} from an allow-list: no contacts, names or notes
            P2->>P2: t = now, v1 = hex HMAC-SHA256(secret, t.rawBody)
            P2->>P5: POST + X-SwiftDrop-Signature: t=..,v1=.. (10 s timeout)
            P5-->>P2: 2xx
            P2->>P3: append attempt (status code, latency), status DELIVERED
        end
